            "text": "Ask the representative: "
          },
          {
            "_key": "d21c1b3f5289",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": ["em"],
            "text": "\"Once my out-of-network deductible is met, what percentage of the session fee is reimbursed to me? Also, what is the 'allowed amount' for CPT code 90837?\""
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
